Git Real-Time Team Practice Lab

4 Developers + Feature Branches + PR/MR + Rebase + Merge Conflicts

This lab simulates a real company Git workflow.

We have:

- "main" → production branch
- "develop" → integration branch
- 4 developers
- Each developer works on a separate feature branch
- Developers create commits
- Developers push feature branches
- Developers create PR/MR
- Developers rebase with "develop"
- We intentionally create merge conflicts
- Developers resolve conflicts
- PR/MR is reviewed and merged

